					Pl.
					<u>Phdr.</u>
					277a
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὰ ἄ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Arist.
					<u>EN</u>
					1125a11
				</span></i>
			. Adv.
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">-πως</span>”
